/F1 9 Tf 72 760 Td (PtSh_A\(Cart\) <-> PtSh_A\(V\) over the supported point-generated actor-causal site. In) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 72 747 Td (particular, the linear exponential at this sheaf level is the comonad L_pt R_pt.) Tj
